            "review_title": "Review at Quarter Pub",
            "review_text": "SlowlyinAsia\nVancouver, Canada239 contributions\n0\nHuge Disappointment\nSep 2016 • Solo\nI was stalking through the Old Quarter for dinner, not really wanting pizza but these two funny and attractive young ladies talked me into pizza at this place. I cut a deal for cheap beer if I went in...okay...so in I go. I ordered a medium vegetarian pizza and beer. The pizza contained no veggies...just sauce and cheese...I chastised the girls but in the end it was my choice. True to their word I got a great deal on the beer...a place I will not return to next visit.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 25, 2017",
