            "review_text": "Mia N\n39 contributions\n0\nAwesome pub for live music\nOct 2016 • Friends\nWe went there a couple of times as a group & absolutely love the vibe! Staff are well trained & very attentive. Food is not outstanding, but good. Live music is awesome. The band would even perform the songs on request & let you sing as well. You could sit inside to enjoy the music or outside watching the lively chaos of the old quarter. Great spot!\nRead more\nWritten October 16, 2016",
